<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f4632; padding: 2rem; max-width: 600px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 1.5rem;">Delivery over capacity</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
    The drop-off at <strong><%= @site.name %></strong> on <%= @event.date.strftime("%A, %-d %B") %> went past the
    limits in its facility letter:
  </p>
  <ul style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
    <% @reasons.each do |reason| %>
      <li><%= reason %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
    Worth a word with <%= @site.contact_name.presence || "the site" %><%= " (#{@site.phone_number})" if @site.phone_number.present? %>,
    or raising their limits and getting a fresh letter signed.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 2rem 0;">
    <a href="<%= admin_drop_off_site_url(@site.slug || @site.id) %>"
       style="background-color: #FBB718; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 40px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">
      Open site
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
